! Comprehension: The Master's Book

Read [[Reading/The Master's Book]], then answer ''without'' viewing the gloss.

# Who has the book?
# Which expression means “this book”?
# What does the master teach the disciple?
# Is there any explicit tense inflection in the passage?

<details><summary>Show answers</summary>

# 师父 (shīfu), the master.
# 这本书 (zhè běn shū).
# 剑法 (jiànfǎ), sword techniques.
# No. Mandarin verbs do not inflect for tense, though time can be supplied by context.

</details>

